<!--Post: 12329--><!--Time: 1111992953-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12329"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Icyou<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Icyou<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, March 27, 2005 - 10:55 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tulip!  Aggghh!  I&#39;m a day behind you...I just read the part on Rathbun and the coincidence of the names stopped me cold.  Freaky!  Was checking to see if it was mentioned yet...glad to know we think alike.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
