<!--Post: 12353--><!--Time: 1112044075-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12353"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tulip<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tulip<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->3-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 28, 2005 - 1:07 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Icyou, <BR> <BR>I&#39;m glad you posted, I was wondering if anyone else noticed this.  Definately freaky!  Hey, since we think alike, will you look at what I&#39;ve posted under the &#34;theory&#34; section &#34;Rader and 3 dudes connect?&#34;  I would be interested to know what you think.  You can tell me I&#39;m crazy after you read it if you want.  I won&#39;t be offended!  Thanks!  Tulip<!--/Text--></td></tr>
