<!--Post: 12398--><!--Time: 1112160221-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12398"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Rocky<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Rocky<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 29, 2005 - 9:23 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Great spot you guys. That is pretty freaky, Bryan and Kerri! His hypocracy has no bounds. So, there are three strong coincidentals: <BR>1. Where Ms. Rathbun lived.  <BR>2. The name of her children.  <BR>3. Where they found her body. <BR> <BR>Doesn&#39;t DTDC say or suggest in one of his letters that his MO would change periodically. <BR> <BR>You really can&#39;t discount anything this monster may or may not be responsible for. And I mean anything!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
